alt with a year ago have been a lot to deal with","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/joeyerdon.bsky.social/post/3mzxxudaock2v"},{"a":"Joe Yerdon","d":"2026-11-10T16:17:25+00:00","h":"joeyerdon.bsky.social","o":"Bleacher Report","t":"Sabres practicing and it’s looking like Ryan McLeod will get back in. Jiri Kulich didn’t appear to mix into any rushes and was on the PK against the top PP unit.","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/joeyerdon.bsky.social/post/3mzxtp27vk22z"}],"team":"BUF","threads":[{"d":"2026-11-06T16:53:59+00:00","sub":"sabres","t":"[Matthew Fairburn] Looks like Jiri Kulich could be going in for Ryan McLeod tonight. McLeod wasn’t working on either of the top two PK units at morning skate. Ukko-Pekka Luukkonen in the starter’s net.","u":"https://www.reddit.com/r/sabres/comments/1xphsbg/matthew_fairburn_looks_like_jiri_kulich_could_be/"}],"videos":[{"d":"2026-10-24T20:51:51+00:00","id":"VVa_MTi7sJA","k":"video","t":"“He Was Feeling Good So That’s Encouraging” | Lindy Ruff Gives Update On Kulich | Buffalo Sabres","team":"BUF","u":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VVa_MTi7sJA"}]}